    <entry_item>
      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠠᠨᠢᠢᠯᠺᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>teniilkekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>тэнийлгэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TENIILGE-</transcript>
      <definition>[= teneilge-, v. caus. of tenii-] v.t. To straighten, unbend; to smooth, make even.</definition>
      <page>804</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠨᠢᠢᠯᠺᠠᠵᠦ ᠳᠡᠪᠢᠰᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--zy debisky</transcript>
          <definition> To spread smooth, extend, unfold</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠮᠦᠷ ᠤᠲᠠᠰᠤ ᠲᠠᠨᠢᠢᠯᠺᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>temyr utasu --ky</transcript>
          <definition> To straighten wire.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠦᠶ᠎ᠡ ᠮᠥᠴᠢ ᠪᠡᠨ ᠲᠠᠨᠢᠢᠯᠺᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>yj-e møci ben --ky</transcript>
          <definition> To stretch one's limbs.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>Kowalewski</dico>
      <unicode>ᠳᠡᠨᠢᠢᠯᠺᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
      <definition>faire sécher au soleil. faire blanchir qc au soleil: 2 faire étaler les habits, faire étendre: 3 ordonner de repasser, de rendre uni: 4 métaph. faire tranquilliser , faire apaiser.</definition>
      <page>1689</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠠᠷ ᠢ ᠳᠡᠨᠢᠢᠯᠺᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <definition>tendre la main</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠡᠶ᠎ᠡ ᠎ᠶᠢ ᠳᠡᠨᠢᠢᠯᠺᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <definition>s'étendre, s'allonger</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠦᠰ ᠢ ᠳᠡᠨᠢᠢᠯᠺᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <definition>étendre ou repasser une pièce de toile</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠠᠭᠠᠰᠤᠨ ᠳᠡᠨᠢᠢᠯᠺᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <definition>dérouler, rendre uni un papier</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>Schmidt</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠠᠨᠢᠢᠯᠺᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>deniilkekü</uighur>
      <definition>glatt machen, eben machen; beruhigenn, besänftigen.</definition>
      <page>239</page>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>Boberg</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠠᠨᠢᠢᠯᠺᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>teniilkekü</uighur>
      <definition>To make smooth or even (of wrinkles). To pacify, to appease. To inflate a ball.</definition>
      <page>941</page>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>Chinese</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠡᠨᠢᠢᠯᠭᠡᠬᠦ</unicode>
      <cyrillic>тэнийлгэх</cyrillic>
      <definition>〔动〕тэнийх 的使动态；①使伸直，使延伸，伸展，弄直，拉直，拉展，抻直：төмөр утас ~ 把铁丝弄直；нуруугаа ~ 伸直腰；үе мөчөө ~ 伸懒腰，伸展自己的肢体；②使心情舒展，使放心，安慰，平息，抚慰.</definition>
      <page>1157</page>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>cevel</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠡᠨᠢᠢᠯᠭᠡᠬᠦ</unicode>
      <cyrillic>тэнийлгэх</cyrillic>
      <definition>тэнийхийн үйлдүүлэх хэв; төмөр утас тэнийлгэх; арьс шир тэнийлгэх; үе мөчөө тэнийлгэх; нуруугаа тэнийлгэх.</definition>
      <page>577</page>
    </entry_item>
